      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The dragon brings its wings down, scattering dust within my vicinity.

    I only find a glint of the foul serpent now having pierced the heavens.

    The Prince seeming to visibly plead out his undying love to me through the bars.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
